    "brand": {
      "_about": "Orbit: an accelerating arc that narrows to a bright leading point, and a small four-pointed star at the centre of its sweep, on a deep rounded tile. The geometry is drawn on a 512 grid in desktop/src/lib/brand/orbit.ts; these are its inks. `*-alpha` are 0-1 and `star-glow-blur` is a Gaussian sigma in 512-grid px. The wordmark is `word-ink`, warming to `word-tint` from `word-tint-from` of its width to its end, so the last letters take the arc's light. `dark-*` are the same for light grounds. The lockup sizes are multiples of the wordmark's ascender: the mark is `lockup-mark` ascenders tall and `lockup-gap` from the word, or, stacked, `stacked-mark` tall and `stacked-gap` above it. The wordmark's own tiers live in graphite.wordmark.",
